Version 1.5.0 is a feature release. See ChangeLog for the full list
with contributors.

Features:
    * New default style 'sage'
    * Vertical workspace warping: dragging a window over the top or
      bottom screen edge switches the workspace, like the left and right
      edges do. To switch it off, set
        session.screenN.workspaceWarpingVertical: false
    * Opaque resize (opaqueResize, opaqueResizeDelay)
    * Iconbar: new alignment RelativeSmart, which gives long titles more
      room
    * Edge snapping while resizing (edgeResizeSnapThreshold)
    * AutotabPlacement: new windows are tabbed into the focused one
    * Drag tabs to other workspaces, tooltips for tabs
    * Per-head artificial struts (session.screenN.struts[.<head>])
    * Mark windows and jump back to them (MarkWindow, GotoMarkedWindow)
    * apps file: FocusProtection (None, Lock, Deny, Gain, Refuse),
      IgnoreSizeHints, mixed relative/absolute Position and Dimensions
    * New commands: Unclutter, ActivateTab, SetFocusProtection,
      ToggleToolbarAbove, ToggleToolbarVisible, ToggleSlitAbove,
      ToggleSlitHidden; Next/PrevWorkspace 0 toggles to the last one
    * New mouse contexts: OnWinButton, OnMinButton, OnMaxButton, OnSlit
    * Toolbar: generic labeled command buttons (changeable via
      fluxbox-remote), spacer, autoraise for toolbar and slit
    * Systray icon pinning (systray.pinLeft, systray.pinRight)
    * 4px click dead zone, 5s timeout for key chains
    * fbrun: autocompletion (-autocomplete, -cf), -center, -preselect,
      -pad, text selection, Ctrl+A, UTF-8 input, limited history

General Improvements:
    * Usable on first start even without config files: built-in keys,
      menus and style; the menu and Alt+F1 start your preferred terminal
    * Better placement: centered transients, oversized windows,
      clients asking for off-screen positions, head changes
    * Monitor changes: survives switching a monitor off and on, docking
      stations and changed layouts; panels stay where they belong
    * Smarter toolbar/iconbar layout, iconified windows marked
    * UTF-8 and locale handling
    * Updated vim syntax files

Security:
    * fluxbox-remote can no longer run SetEnv, Export or
      SetResourceValue (allowRemoteActions); scripts that used it to
      change resources or the environment stop working
    * Shell metacharacters in style backgrounds, wallpaper file names,
      fbsetbg's history and generated menus are no longer executed

Critical Bugfixes:
    * Infinite loops in menus and type-ahead search
    * Crashes with some applications (e.g. pcmanfm-qt), without fonts,
      with zero-size fonts, and on ArrangeWindows with shaded windows
    * Pointer freezes after clicking window borders
    * Hangs and glitches when cycling the focus (alt+tab)
    * Wine windows stuck in withdrawn state
    * Transparent (ARGB) windows broke after screen layout changes

Translations:
    * da_DK, fr_FR, he_IL, pt_BR, vi_VN, zh_CN
